     <draw:frame draw:name="Speaker notes" draw:style-name="gr8" draw:text-style-name="P13" draw:layer="layout" svg:width="24cm" svg:height="12cm" svg:x="1cm" svg:y="1cm">
      <draw:text-box>
       <text:p text:style-name="P8"><text:span text:style-name="T5">Timing: 00:55. Explain the main path: GUI/controllers call workflows; CrewAI and a configured model propose artifacts; people review. Approved packages are stored. Running an approved application does not invoke agents; a maintained native worker applies the Windows boundary and returns bounded observations. The diagram is simplified and does not imply microservices.</text:span></text:p>
      </draw:text-box>
     </draw:frame>
    </presentation:notes>
