      <draw:text-box>
       <text:p text:style-name="P8"><text:span text:style-name="T5">Timing: 00:35. This slide is optional and independently removable. Excel ingestion, normalization, outlier detection and export are planned, not verified implemented functionality. Removing the slide does not alter the preceding example or subsequent security discussion.</text:span></text:p>
